-------------------------
 Custom Scan (SiftCount)
   Index: pw_idx
   Query: 'tk*'::text
(3 rows)

EXPLAIN (COSTS OFF) SELECT id FROM pw WHERE body @@> 'tk*' ORDER BY sift.score(ctid) DESC LIMIT 5;
             QUERY PLAN             
------------------------------------
 Limit
   ->  Custom Scan (SiftScan) on pw
         Index: pw_idx
         Query: 'tk*'::text
         Order: score DESC
         Limit Hint: 5
(6 rows)

